REVIEW.md

# Helper / operator scripts and planning docs — keep locally, shield from future commits.
# Anchored with leading `/` so they only match at repo root and don't catch nested
# directories like accumulate-lite-client-2/liteclient/scripts/.
# Several files under /scripts/ contain hardcoded testnet keys — treat them as compromised.
/scripts/
/implementation-prompts/
/implementation-planning-doc/
/temp-docs/

# Junk artifacts from accidental shell glob expansion (e.g. literal `{}` filename)
**/{}

# Misc backup / pre-refactor copies (defensive — these often contain stale secrets)
*.bak
*.bak2
*.pre-refactor
*.old
!*.example.bak

# Exceptions for the vendored accumulate-lite-client-2/liteclient/ project — its own
# tracked files share names with our validator binaries (docker-compose.yml, txhash/)
# but are legitimate source code in that sub-project. Narrow to *.go so that built
# binaries (txhash.exe) and tmp artifacts (tmpclaude-*) stay ignored by the broader
# rules above.
!accumulate-lite-client-2/liteclient/docker-compose.yml
!accumulate-lite-client-2/liteclient/proof/consolidated_governance-proof/cmd/txhash/
!accumulate-lite-client-2/liteclient/proof/consolidated_governance-proof/cmd/txhash/*.go
bls_zk_keys_bls12381_v2/

# Python bytecode
__pycache__/
*.pyc
